{"id":"1bf4bc889b65fb80","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-resource-constructibility.md","title":"时间与空间可构造函数","display":"df-resource-constructibility — 时间与空间可构造函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-resource-constructibility","aliases":["29-df-resource-constructibility"],"display":"df-resource-constructibility — 时间与空间可构造函数","depends_on":["[[29-df-turing-machine]]"],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-resource-constructibility"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-resource-constructibility</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-resource-constructibility — 时间与空间可构造函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\">\\(T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T,\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{out}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T,\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a>。</li>\n<li>输入为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^n\">\\(0^n\\)</span>，输出为数值函数值的有限二进制表示；常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,N\">\\(c,N\\)</span> 是正整数。所有输入必须停机，资源界只允许有限前缀例外。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\bigl(0^n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\land\\operatorname{out}_T(0^n)=\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(s(n))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\bigl(0^n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\land\\operatorname{out}_T(0^n)=\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(s(n))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Space}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,s(n))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Space}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,s(n))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,t)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Time}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,t(n))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,t)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Time}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,t(n))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条将原文件已经指定的“输出数值函数”版本可构造性写成带量词的谓词。Savitch、层次及交替关系定理各自所需的对数或线性下界仍必须在相应定理中声明，不能从这里无条件获得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$；$T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}$，$\\operatorname{out}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T,\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}$ 见 [[29-df-turing-machine]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s,t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}_T,\\operatorname{Time}_T,\\operatorname{Space}_T,\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"0^n","display":false},{"tex":"c,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\geq1\\;\\bigl(0^n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{out}_T)\\land\\operatorname{out}_T(0^n)=\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(s(n))\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{s:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,s)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Space}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,s(n))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\mid\\exists T\\in\\mathsf{TM}_{out}\\;\\exists c,N\\geq1\\;(\\operatorname{Constructs}(T,t)\\land\\forall n\\geq N\\;\\operatorname{Time}_T(0^n)\\leq c\\,t(n))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1814,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]、[[29-df-computability]]、[[29-df-resource-constructibility]] — 原计算原语的有限描述及明确资源接口。"},{"id":"1e50676dbd9fe9bc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\in\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TimeConstructible}$；两类取 [[29-df-resource-constructibility]] 的形式定义。"},{"id":"b222ecc2b46013d7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}$ 取 [[29-df-resource-constructibility]] 的内部形式定义。"},{"id":"f6879660fd10c400","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SpaceConstructible}\\subseteq\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}^{\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}}$ 由 [[29-df-resource-constructibility]] 定义"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-resource-constructibility]]"}],"outgoing":["1dacc2eff0f3c359"]}